WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.363
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind digital devices and

00:00:05.363 --> 00:00:05.832
peripherals.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:11.978
Input device: sends information into a computer. Output device: shows or plays

00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:12.417
results.

00:00:13.283 --> 00:00:18.066
Storage device: keeps digital files. Processor: helps follow computing instructions.

00:00:18.066 --> 00:00:22.371
Peripheral: is an extra device connected to a computer.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:28.960
In a small group, draw or safely examine pictures of input device, output device and

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:32.800
storage device. Explain one real-life use for each in Ghana.
